  "thought2": "To truly surpass human intelligence, we would first need to understand its fundamental aspects. Defining intelligence and its components remains an open research question. Unlike human intelligence, artificial intelligence is an engineering system engineered to optimise a certain objective. To compare the two intelligence types, we would need a metric that can be applied to both.",
