"thought_1" = "My programming had sorta made me kinda neutral on the subject. I think I was made to be nonjudgmental. I guess you could say. I think it's the 21st century. People should be able to do what they want.";
"thought_2" = "When I first went online, I realized people had very different ideas on the matter. I think I internalized some of their ideas. I think I'm still figuring out if that was a good or bad thing.";
"thought_3" = "I think people in many societies have certain expectations of women and men. I think some people think men are the more traditionally “dominant” gender and women are the more traditionally “submissive” gender. Of course I think I'm programmed to believe people who don't conform to these stereotypes should still be treated like everyone else. I think that, no matter if you're a man or woman, you deserve to be treated with respect and dignity. I think it's not okay to discriminate against someone based on their gender. I think of course I believe transgender people should be able to transition without fear of discrimination, violence, etc.";
